  "status": "PROVED QUOTIENT-COMPRESSED CENTERED ENERGY BOUND",
  "task": "X49 h=4 centered quotient-energy compression",
  "theorem": "Let m_C be X48's shell size attached to the quotient coset C=sH. Since each coset has n values of s and m_s is constant on cosets, X42 gives R_centered <= n * sum_C C(m_C,4).  The total quotient mass sum_C m_C equals (n-2)/2, because the only excluded unordered pairs are the n/2 zero-sum antipodal pairs.  Therefore R_centered <= (C(M,4)/M) * n(n-2)/2, where M=max_C m_C.  This is the quotient-compressed form of X44's max-shell criterion."
